  "change": "Parent eleven existing workbench QShortcuts to the visible appSurface page instead of the whole MainWindow. Default WindowShortcut scope and all action handlers remain unchanged. Settings is a separate stacked page, so hidden workbench actions do not dispatch. Global Settings shortcut stays global. Workbench action shortcuts reactivate after Back and remain active while compact navigation temporarily hides its content splitter.",
